--

COMMENT ON COLUMN public.exploration_thread.canceled_at IS 'Set when the user stops a running thread via the cancel endpoint. Set together with `completed_at` so existing terminal-state predicates keep working; `canceled_at IS NOT NULL` is the cause marker that distinguishes a cancel from a natural completion.';


